<figure id="A6.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>
Pretraining with multi-cell masking.
Masked cells contribute to the loss.
The target cell is always masked.
Other cells are masked with probability <span id="A6.T11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">P(mask)</span>.
<span id="A6.T11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">NP</span> denotes no pretraining.
Shading is proportional to difference from the P(mask) <math id="A6.T11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=0.0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=0.0</annotation></semantics></math> column.
</figcaption>
